        <h2 class="section-title text-white!">出發前最常問的問題</h2>
        <p class="section-lead text-white/[.58]!">答案以官方資料和安全原則整理。涉及當日天候、施工、活動與臨時管制時，仍以現場公告為準。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal"><FaqList items={faqs} /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-[#e8b8a5]">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="reveal relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem] bg-forest-950 px-6 py-12 text-white shadow-2xl sm:px-10 md:py-16 lg:px-16">
        <div class="absolute -right-12 -top-24 size-72 rounded-full border-[48px] border-white/[.05]"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-32 right-44 size-64 rounded-full bg-cypress-500/[.20] blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-black tracking-[.2em] text-[#e9b29d]">準備出發</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">帶上野餐墊、飲水與頭盔，開始你的大溪河濱半日</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-white/[.60]">免費入園、全天開放。天候與現場狀況正常時，上午是親子遊玩的穩妥選擇。</p>
          </div>
          <a href={site.mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-6 text-base font-black text-forest-950 transition hover:-translate-y-1">
            <Icon name="pin" size={20} /> 立即導航
